# ORACLY — Global Visual Quality System

Canonical: `docs/GLOBAL_VISUAL_QUALITY_SYSTEM.md`  
Art detail: `docs/PHOTOREALISTIC_ART_STANDARD.md`  
Pipeline: `docs/PHOTOREALISTIC_IMAGE_ASSET_PIPELINE.md`  
Chrome: `OraclyArtDirection` · `OraclyChrome`

## Shared DNA (never invent a second style)

near-black · midnight navy · deep violet · antique gold · warm ivory · cinematic darkness · realistic lighting · real materials · controlled contrast · editorial typography

~70% calm dark · ~20% violet/navy · ~10% antique gold.

## Feature identity (subject changes — chrome does not)

| Feature | Identity |
|---------|----------|
| Home | Cinematic entrance |
| Coffee | Warm Turkish coffee ritual |
| Palm | Real hand on dark velvet |
| Astrology | Luxury observatory / instrument |
| Yıldızname | Ancient celestial archive |
| Tarot | Real premium deck on velvet |
| SoulMate | Cinematic real portrait |
| OR | Minimal living intelligence — not giant orb, not mascot |
| Profile | Private cinematic journal |
| Premium | Luxury chamber / premium artifact |

## Major images

Photorealistic only. Reject illustration, vector, cartoon, anime, flat fantasy, generic 3D, game art, plastic faces, fake hands.

**No baked title/logo/CTA/body/feature name** — Flutter owns all text.

## Before shipping art

Pass photorealism · materials · lighting · composition · brand consistency · feature distinction · mobile readability.

AI-illustration look → REJECT.
